  "title": "Grilled Green Chile Turkey Burgers",
  "description": "Canned green chilies and fresh jalapeno pepper add quite a kick to these easy grilled turkey burgers topped with Monterey Jack cheese.",
  "authors": [
    "Emmurphy"
  ],
